      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ダグシオンにあったサラミスの勇士を模した石像、\nどこかの愚か者がそれを盗んだとのことでな。\n我らも動き、盗人を成敗してやるつもりだ。\nその討伐、おぬしも助力してくれぬか？",
        "official_en": "Some contemptible louts have stolen a stone statue\nfrom Dagsion depicting a brave warrior of Saramis.\nWe are taking action to bring the thieves to justice.\nWould you assist us in defeating them?",
        "real_en": null
      },
